 sh(2,'tall-wine-list-in-bronze-stand-white-cloth-flute','A tall narrow wine list card stands upright in a small bronze stand on the white tablecloth, a champagne flute beside it catching the warm beam.','Camera at table height, 85mm lens, f/4, square to the card face. The card fills about 30 percent of the frame width and most of its height on the centre line, sharp; the flute stands to one side, its rising bubbles glowing and its bright caustic falling on the cloth, never over the card; a soft dark dining room behind.',CARD('WINE LIST CARD'),'the wine list card',comp=None),
 sh(3,'place-card-ivory-linen-folded-napkin-tumbler','A small folded place card stands on ivory oat linen in front of a neatly folded linen napkin, a clear crystal tumbler of water beside it.','Camera at about 30 degrees above the table, 85mm lens, f/4, square to the card face. The card face fills about 40 percent of the frame width on the centre line, sharp; the tumbler at one side throws a bright ring of caustic light on the linen; the napkin behind, soft.',CARD('PLACE CARD FACE'),'the place card face',comp=None),
 sh(4,'single-coaster-bronze-table-two-crystal-tumblers','A single round coaster lies on the polished bronze table between two clear crystal tumblers of water, their twin caustics crossing on the metal.','Camera straight down, 50mm lens, f/5.6. The coaster sits on the centre line, filling about 45 percent of the frame width, sharp; one tumbler at the top left and one at the lower right, each throwing a bright caustic and long shadow across the warm bronze beside the coaster, never over it.',RD('COASTER'),'the coaster'),
 sh(5,'bill-card-on-bronze-tray-two-espresso-cups','A small bill card rests on a polished bronze tray on white marble, beside two empty white espresso cups on saucers.','Camera straight down, 50mm lens, f/5.6. The tray sits on the centre line; the card on it fills about 35 percent of the frame width, sharp, edges parallel to the frame; the two cups at the side; the warm beam throws their round shadows across the marble.',CARD('BILL CARD'),'the bill card'),
